<title>USA: Nichols Research sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Nichols Research sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nichols Research Corp said on Wednesday that its board has approved a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>The stock split will become effective for shareholders of record on October 21, 1996, and will be effected by a stock dividend of one share for every two shares of Common Stock outstanding to be paid on November 4, 1996, Nichols said.</p>
<p>Cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares based on the value of the stock on the record date, the company said.</p>
